   "title": "Transformations",
   "content": "<p><strong>Translation:</strong> Slide by a vector \\(\\binom{a}{b}\\). <strong>Reflection:</strong> Mirror in a line (x-axis, y-axis, y=x, etc.). <strong>Rotation:</strong> Turn about a centre by an angle (state direction). <strong>Enlargement:</strong> Scale from a centre by a scale factor (SF). Negative SF inverts.</p>",
   "example": "<p><strong>Translate \\((3, 2)\\) by \\(\\binom{-4}{1}\\).</strong></p><p>New point: \\((3-4, 2+1) = (-1, 3)\\).</p>"
